---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import type { Lang } from '../../i18n/ui';

interface Props { lang: Lang }
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const isEn = lang === 'en';
---

<Base
  title={isEn ? 'Floral Course Schedule Posters' : '花艺课程表海报'}
  description={isEn ? 'An experiment in AI-assisted poster design.' : '一次 AI 辅助海报设计的尝试。'}
  lang={lang}
>
  <article class="story">
    <header class="story-hero" data-fade>
      <p class="story-eyebrow">Design · 2026</p>
      <h1 class="story-title">{isEn ? 'Floral Course Schedule Posters' : '花艺课程表海报'}</h1>
      <p class="story-sub">{isEn ? 'An experiment in AI-assisted poster design.' : '一次 AI 辅助海报设计的尝试。'}</p>
    </header>

    <div class="story-body">
      <figure class="story-figure">
        <img
          src="/cards/projects-card.jpg"
          alt={isEn ? 'Course schedule posters for the zero-basis class and the all-around class' : '零基础创业班与创业全能班课程表海报'}
          loading="eager"
        />
      </figure>

      {isEn ? (
        <>
          <p>
            A course schedule poster designed for a floral studio to introduce its zero-basis startup class and all-around startup class to prospective students during enrollment. It was also an experiment in AI-assisted poster design: using AI to explore information hierarchy and layout, then refining the result around the studio’s actual course content.
          </p>
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          <p>
            为一家花艺工作室制作的招生课程海报，用来在招生阶段向潜在学员介绍零基础创业班和创业全能班的课程安排。这也是一次 AI 辅助海报设计的尝试：借助 AI 探索信息层级和版式，再结合工作室的真实课程内容完成调整。
          </p>
        </>
      )}
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .story {
    padding: 0 96px 160px;
  }

  .story-hero {
    max-width: 768px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 160px 0 72px;
  }

  .story-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 22px;
    letter-spacing: -0.28px;
    color: #707070;
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
  }

  .story-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 60px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 72px;
    letter-spacing: -1.2px;
    color: #000;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .story-sub {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 60px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 72px;
    letter-spacing: -1.2px;
    color: #707070;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .story-body {
    max-width: 768px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .story-body p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 42px;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    color: #000;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .story-body p + p {
    margin-top: 1.5em;
  }

  .story-figure {
    margin: 48px 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .story-figure:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .story-figure img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .story {
      padding: 0 24px 80px;
    }

    .story-hero {
      padding: 120px 0 56px;
    }

    .story-title,
    .story-sub {
      font-size: 36px;
      line-height: 44px;
      letter-spacing: -0.72px;
    }

    .story-body p {
      font-size: 19px;
      line-height: 33px;
    }

    .story-figure {
      margin: 40px 0;
    }

    .story-figure:first-child {
      margin-top: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
